<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mycom year net down six pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mycom year net down six pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  57.28   vs	  61.19</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 16.0    vs	  18.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   680.00   vs	 714.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   119.51   vs	 135.56</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 32.08   vs  less  41.26</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   10.79   vs	   0.58</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	 7.5    vs	   7.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Mycom Bhd is involved in gaming and leisure activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
